        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Inspect While Stuck",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Bare `git diff` shows a combined diff vs both parents",
            "`--ours` / `--theirs` / `--base` compare one stage",
            "`git mergetool` opens a three-pane tool",
            "`git diff --check` catches stray markers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "7. Finish Or Unwind",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`git add <file>` is what marks a path resolved",
            "Then `git merge --continue` or `git rebase --continue`",
            "`--abort` unwinds to the pre-operation state"
