            "*.png             binary",
            "# .git/config -- REQUIRED too",
            "[merge \"ours\"] driver = true"
          ],
          "note": "no driver defined = attribute does nothing"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "cloud",
          "title": "Semantic Conflict",
          "text": "Both sides merge cleanly, result is broken: one branch renames a function, the other adds a call to the old name. Git cannot see this. Only tests can."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "With no conflicts both give the same tree. The entire difference is recorded history, not shipped code."
        }
